--
-- NEW CONTENT (Debug Area, DA-10): Z10, the Visual NPC Lineup, in the east
-- wing of world 1300's south compound
-- (docs/content/debug-area.md#visual-npc-lineup).
--
-- Id block: templates 1410-1599 (DA-10). 161 passive display actors: one per
-- distinct character look in entity_templates (155) and one per character
-- body set no template uses (6). A look is the body set, the component set
-- (in any order), the two colours, the skin tint and the static mesh, with
-- NULL and '' the same (the client treats both as no static mesh), which
-- merges Nerus (53, NULL) and Sandbox Greeting NPC (166, '') into one look
-- (docs/content/debug-area.md, "Coverage delta: 162 to 161"). Props
-- (GLB_Components.*) and deployables and mines (WP-Human.*) are not
-- characters: they belong to the planned Z11 Props / Interactables Gallery.
-- The lineup covers every visual appearance, not every template: each actor
-- is cloned from the lowest template id with its look, and the comment above
-- it lists every template that shares the look.
--
-- A clone copies the source's body set, components, colours, skin tint,
-- static mesh, level and name_id. Its nameplate is `display_name`,
-- "<name> #<source template id> <body set>" (the name_id text, or the
-- template name when the source has none; 40 characters at most), sent as
-- onBeingNameUpdate after the name_id text; the six template-less actors read
-- "(no template) <body set>". Everything else is fixed: faction 1 (World
-- Object: players cannot attack it, no faction in the reaction table is
-- hostile to it, and it never looks for NPC targets), class mob, and no event
-- set, ability set, loot, vendor lists, dialog, interaction sets, speaker,
-- patrol or wander.
--
-- The six template-less body sets are dressed from resources.body_components
-- (every component listed for the set, or the base head, torso, legs, hands
-- and boots for HM_Mesh.HM_BodySet, whose parts carry no slot names).
--
-- Rows are in walk order: humans, Jaffa, Goa'uld, Asgard, children,
-- creatures, machines; inside a group by body set, then by source template
-- id. A template added later with a new look fails
-- live_db_debug_area_lineup until it gets a row here and a spawn in
-- spawnlist_debug_area_lineup.sql.
--
-- Humans, male
-- source 10 Col Marsh (pet)
