-- ============================================================
-- Lineup attendants (1590-1595)
-- ============================================================
--
-- Six Airmen at the doorway, one per button: a right-click fires the
-- attendant's interact_tag chain (debug_area_lineup_chains.sql), whose
-- `spawn_set` action shows one lineup group for the whole world (switching
-- off the one that was on) or clears the lineup. GM-gated in the action: a
-- player gets "Only a GM can switch the lineup." INT_Trainer (128) with no
-- list, like the plaza's ability granter, for the click cursor. The
-- nameplate (`display_name`) is the button's label. Not lineup actors: the
-- lineup guards stop at 1589.
